{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_002_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7c18179a645833ebdce9d1f1233c293f8689473c167e028a774d09cba8ce89d6", "ja": "（今日は、桃子のアイドルとしての初仕事……\n宣材写真の撮影だ！）", "zh": "（今天是桃子当上偶像后的第一份工作……\n拍摄宣传照！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_002_1001_p", "source_sha256": "6a0d54c68cc013068e92e1e9f23a741ff7135a54a06d13bcdd8eecc3f88c92da", "ja": "（が、前の撮影が押して待ち時間になっているせいか、\n桃子の機嫌が悪くなってきた……まずいな）", "zh": "（但是，在我们前面的拍摄延迟，必须等他们拍好，\n桃子似乎因而不太开心……不妙啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_002_1002_049mom", "source_sha256": "f38cc3420d3be54f906265a6c26ac85673ac6f7aba3db100ac8373e42214b604", "ja": "んっ、しょっと……。", "zh": "嗯，嘿咻……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_002_1003_049mom", "source_sha256": "480762c5e637356844f9d6466978e6f6904f5f34450eaf74e9a0a339bdf48506", "ja": "もう、信じられない！\n時間厳守は、プロの基本だよ！？", "zh": "真是的，太夸张了！\n守时是基本的专业表现吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_002_1004_049mom", "source_sha256": "7b0792a9716553451216f85ffb14d30c3ba23af179fa9fee4ae223faf8f37979", "ja": "今日は、この撮影だけだからいいけど……。\n桃子に別の予定があったら、どうするつもりだったの！", "zh": "还好今天桃子只有这场拍摄工作……\n要是还有其他行程被耽搁，他们要怎么弥补！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_002_1005_p", "source_sha256": "c6fc7698cb0eacb8acd77e405f2243390cfe0c760db8f5fed58cef3894256184", "ja": "まあまあ桃子、少し落ち着こう。\nジュース飲むか？", "zh": "息怒息怒，桃子，稍微冷静一下。\n要喝果汁吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_002_1006_049mom", "source_sha256": "1744b623a63e777512d102151f20d5ee4fd467fe1e739821013121b71ba30a8a", "ja": "む……お兄ちゃん！？\nいい、桃子は女優なんだよ！", "zh": "唔……大哥哥！？\n你听清楚，桃子可是演员耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_002_1007_p", "source_sha256": "9355d7f0f02479d5c5b76c717a0b0b8b4da9ad6c20fc6637f1c8ebe8297db274", "ja": "今日の桃子は、新人アイドルだろ。\nまだ仕事も入ってないし、よかったな！", "zh": "但今天的桃子是偶像圈的新人吧。\n况且又没有排其他工作，真是万幸！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_002_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "fccfb9a81560dd79cbd9b1df07b47e0993f476e4cd2e93beb5502e2277acb28e", "ja": "そうだけど、そういう問題じゃないの！\n芸能界は、時間に厳しいんだからね！", "zh": "是这样没错，但问题不在那里！\n演艺圈是很讲求守时的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_002_1009_049mom", "source_sha256": "49e4858ca2dca4922acfbacb5701174bec7a97f39d90b569b18d65162189130f", "ja": "ま、ジュースは飲むけど♪\nちょうど喉が渇いてたし。", "zh": "算了，果汁还是要喝♪\n桃子正好口渴了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_002_1010_p", "source_sha256": "12270762f6a8a3ad9350633b122b2552be5c99654ad2f7bedbe224334d2eb2d1", "ja": "（飲むんだ……）", "zh": "（结果还是要喝啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_002_1011_049mom", "source_sha256": "601e2a0ce11caef8efc780d381782a6c51d388d6f9f705b189a4cc114557339a", "ja": "ねぇ、お兄ちゃん。\n待ってる間ヒマだから、何か面白いことして。", "zh": "欸，大哥哥。\n在这边等也是闲着，你表演一些有趣的才艺吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_002_1012_p", "source_sha256": "28812f7deda6e92aaff968d4073602f8cdacf1139cc9b97f0b93dccd77d039ba", "ja": "面白いこと？", "zh": "有趣的才艺？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_002_1013_049mom", "source_sha256": "4bc8e60c1afcffbf18ded91de28e9ae61066bacb0501af9b38af59ceeb4e308c", "ja": "だって、桃子つまんないんだもん。\nこのままじゃ、笑って写真、撮れないかも。", "zh": "因为桃子现在很无聊嘛。\n再这么无聊下去，待会拍照时可能会笑不出来哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_002_1014_p", "source_sha256": "6a0fb2f5e01be48c43bcdec2905d6e909e6dcbf72c7c2c5ae47c4e6047035f13", "ja": "む、無茶振りするなぁ。\nそれじゃあ、社長のモノマネで……。", "zh": "你、你还真是强人所难啊。\n那我来模仿社长好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_002_1015_049mom", "source_sha256": "4bcadb08de6df7565e24b730c93adbb8d3c711ec4f3ce717a66a8020c651cd99", "ja": "もう、なにそれ。\nお兄ちゃん、手抜いてるでしょ？", "zh": "真是的，什么东西啊？\n大哥哥，你是不是随便敷衍桃子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_002_1016_049mom", "source_sha256": "a50a32bcb2944d7f7836dfbac737c80069798b59166684491e1bbb92a7a2ba77", "ja": "桃子、そういうのわかるんだからね。\nこういう些細なことから、信頼って失われるんだよ。", "zh": "桃子都看得出来好吗？\n一个人的信用就是从这种小地方开始流失的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_002_1017_049mom", "source_sha256": "6201edf28c2dee3e74050c3f6d638548aa8824743e527d362cba7cb32e14642d", "ja": "そんな適当なことする人に、プロデューサーなんて\n任せられないよ。桃子のプロデューサー失格だね！", "zh": "怎么能让这么随便的人担任制作人？\n你没资格当桃子的制作人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_002_1018_p", "source_sha256": "67312e52e12007aa0d56fdbbe88f52b93f4106bd179fc186933e1b4346a3e29b", "ja": "うっ……わ、わかった、わかったから！\nそれじゃあ、本格的なやつを……！", "zh": "呜……好、好啦，我重来一次就是了！\n那我这次要认真模仿啰……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_002_1019_se", "source_sha256": "8e7f14ac05b8af6347c8336517efb85357319e29b9542e34b554f154c45397ba", "ja": "コンコン", "zh": "叩叩。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_002_1020_staff", "source_sha256": "41e7dd3e67a91f1c8a4fe09594c5b6495b52b094b4ff48eb5e6040d7f358d2cf", "ja": "周防さん、お願いしまーす！", "zh": "周防小姐，麻烦准备上场了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_002_1021_049mom", "source_sha256": "facb19f039f48427d4603cf9bd11e57e1e031b7bb5fc65d40e0dfe61caa2c6f4", "ja": "はい！　すぐ行きます！\n……お兄ちゃん、グズグズしてないで行くよ！", "zh": "好的！马上就过去！\n……大哥哥，别拖拖拉拉的，快走吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_002_1022_p", "source_sha256": "5b598dcc69ef8358b4e29f5fb46c704925166eb31f19e39a460c5493a0283f36", "ja": "（す、すごい変わり身の早さだ……。\nけどやっぱり、プロ意識の高さがすごいな！）", "zh": "（变、变脸的速度好快……\n不过她真的好敬业！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_002_1023_049mom", "source_sha256": "139e1804972611c52d7349a199a56a5f867930864eb49b88566acbce780f3e3b", "ja": "次は、振り返って笑顔……。\nえっと、こんな感じですか？", "zh": "接下来是转身摆出笑容……\n请问，是像这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_002_1024_p", "source_sha256": "813f3a476df13f90d4c789c320a7080ec8e8a407486ad2e32bfbff0a9e35eb22", "ja": "（撮影は順調……\nどうやら、心配する必要なかったみたいだな）", "zh": "（拍摄很顺利……\n看来不需要我担心了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_002_1025_049mom", "source_sha256": "d870767e4f3e44e309c4c2d4df862ad8e1ad5fbf1304d253ef12cb7fac6f500c", "ja": "……。\nフンッ。", "zh": "……\n哼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_002_1026_049mom", "source_sha256": "3ae4a5ef9edd177fbdb4e47dc8a6fb3dd4246ffb956d30a34aeeea195a836e01", "ja": "いーっだ。", "zh": "讨厌鬼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_002_1027_p", "source_sha256": "1a125054101d8ba15fa62d84089318eafae898596f873c937ca5a64f03d5325a", "ja": "わ、わざわざ俺だけに見えるように、\nそんな顔してみせなくても……。", "zh": "没、没必要特地从只有我看得到的角度\n摆出那种表情吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_049mom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_049mom_002_1028_p", "source_sha256": "2b949eb4d848e90de994d949900d6b074ff5b0e224b1d4cdffba6a6c84246856", "ja": "（写真はよく撮れたけど、桃子の信頼を得るには、\nまだまだ時間がかかるかもしれないな……）", "zh": "（虽然照片拍得很棒，但是要获得桃子的信任，\n恐怕还需要很多时间……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
